# Demonstrate that the harness can assert on failing executions too.
#
# This program leaves 17 elements on the stack (the result plus the 16 padding
# zeros), which the VM rejects at program end. The debugger surfaces the error
# and the prompt switches to the ERR state.
begin
    push.3
    push.4
    add
end
---
continue
# CHECK: Program terminated with error: stack should have at most 16 elements
stack
# CHECK: ERR
# CHECK: [0] 7
